  "description": "G13 Conifer Tree - Reduce in height by 4/5m due to heavy lean. Reason for works - Maintenance and preservation.\rG13 Monkey Puzzle - Crown lift sharp from face height. Reason for works - Maintenance, preservation and to allow clearance. \rG13 Boundary - 1x Boundary line located on Half Moon Lane from the neighbours driveway up to the pedestrian crossing. Crown lift all trees - remove any branches/limbs leaning on the fence and remove any shrubs obstructing the new fence installation. Reason for works - the school are planning on having a new fence installed. \rT16 Lime Tree - Crown lift and remove epicormic growth. Reason for works - Maintenance and preservation."
